      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "親がなくとも子は育つとはよく言ったもんじゃい。",
        "official_en": "“A child still grows in the absence of parents.” ’Tis quite an apt saying.",
        "real_en": "It's true what they say: children grow up even without their parents."
      },
